# [MyUnion: [type [or Integer Null]]] registers a type alias whose body is Union(Int, Null).
# At runtime, the type dict is empty (or-typed aliases have no constructors to inject).
# A value annotated with @MyUnion must be Int or Null.
[
  MyUnion: [type [or Integer Null]]
  v: [@MyUnion 42]
]
=== out
["MyUnion": []  "v": 42]
